00:34:34.360 --> 00:34:35.090
Cepat sekarang.

00:35:05.710 --> 00:35:06.710
Puan Liang?

00:35:39.090 --> 00:35:39.960
Puan Yunwan.

00:35:42.320 --> 00:35:43.280
Puan Yunwan.

00:35:51.880 --> 00:35:52.610
Siapa di sana?

00:35:52.710 --> 00:35:53.240
Siapakah ia?

00:35:54.000 --> 00:35:54.510
Berhenti!

00:35:57.030 --> 00:35:59.150
Tolong! Seseorang tolong!

00:35:59.150 --> 00:35:59.550
Pergi!

00:36:00.510 --> 00:36:02.070
Puan Yunwan. Puan Yunwan.

00:36:02.590 --> 00:36:03.590
Datang dan bantu segera!

00:36:03.590 --> 00:36:04.510
Tolong!

00:36:04.670 --> 00:36:05.920
