Encik Bai!

00:36:52.320 --> 00:36:53.550
Encik Bai! Bangun!

00:36:54.360 --> 00:36:55.220
Bai Yingsheng!

00:37:04.620 --> 00:37:06.150
Bai Yingsheng! Bangun sekarang!

